Z||000003||Oreif||05-11-2000||09:46 AM||||PDF files are Photoshop format. Open Photoshop then open the picture. Go under FILE and then "SAVE A COPY AS..." then save it as a jpeg (.jpg) then post the jpg.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Old Lar||05-11-2000||08:04 PM||||I have my photos all .jpg format. <P>When I click on the downloaded pip file, (Pennock's Image poster)Acrobat reader says "File does not begin with '%PDF-".  I am unable to unzip this file to go into start up.exe .  Am I missing an unzip program??<P>I do this at work an the programs just start working.||||reg||5
Z||000005||Cliff Pennock||05-11-2000||08:49 PM||||Ah - I get it. For some reason Acrobat is set up to handle zip files on your machine. You need to download and install a program like WinZip first: <A HREF="http://www.winzip.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.winzip.com</A> ||||reg||1
